@title Tactics Ogre - The Knight of Lodis (USA)
@file Tactics Ogre - The Knight of Lodis (U) [!].gba
@game ATOE
@chip FLASH
@status wip: reaches the first (tutorial) battle after the name "AA", the default birthday, the tarot questions (default answers) and the prologue; nothing is written to flash before it. The battle has to be won, and with A-mashing the three emulators already diverge on the first turn (an out-of-range warning in one). A human should record: name, birthday, tarot answers, win the first battle, then save at the first save prompt / world-map menu and quit after the save message. [load]: title > Load/Continue > the slot > resume.

# The opening scene runs until START skips it to the name entry.

[new]
wait 1200
mash A until text "sound" timeout=2400 every=30
press START
until text "Enter name" timeout=600 every=10
wait 30
checkpoint enter_name window=0
press A after=20
until text "Select letter" timeout=300 every=5
press A after=30
# type "AA", START to finish
press A after=20
press A after=20
press START
until text "OK?" timeout=300 every=5
wait 20
checkpoint name_ok window=0
press A
until text "birthdate" timeout=300 every=5
wait 30
checkpoint birthday window=0
press A
until text "Yes" timeout=300 every=5
wait 20
press A
# tarot questions, then the prologue narration (default answers everywhere)
mash A until text "BATTLE START" timeout=20000 every=30
checkpoint battle_start window=0 compare=none
